WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:02.105
- Hey Gary, my name is Richard.

00:00:02.105 --> 00:00:02.938
- [Gary] Hey Richard.

00:00:02.938 --> 00:00:03.900
- My daughter's 17,

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:06.140
she's going to a meeting
tonight with my wife,

00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:08.870
- Yes.
- to discuss with her school,

00:00:08.870 --> 00:00:10.750
her university options.

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:12.320
What she wants to do.

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:14.170
She's incredibly courageous.

00:00:14.170 --> 00:00:15.880
Marketing mind, communications mind.

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:17.170
I'm taping you right now,

00:00:17.170 --> 00:00:18.560
and I'd like do you to talk to her,

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:20.490
like she was your 17 year old daughter.

00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:23.620
In terms of how she should
consider her university career.

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:25.440
How she should maximize that experience,

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:26.450
to prepare her for the world,

00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:28.960
that you see she may be entering into.

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:30.208
- Oof...

00:00:30.208 --> 00:00:31.160
(crowd applauds)

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:32.210
Um...

00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:33.043
so...

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:35.400
- Her name is Kiara.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:38.540
- Kiara, I have no idea
what's about to happen,

00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:40.760
but it's about to get interesting, Kiara.

00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:42.350
Here's what I would say, Kiara.

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:45.450
I would tell you that there's
not a school on Earth,

00:00:45.450 --> 00:00:48.310
not a university or college that exists,

00:00:48.310 --> 00:00:51.380
that is even remotely equipped,

00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:53.240
to educate you properly,

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:55.140
on communications and marketing,

00:00:55.140 --> 00:00:57.170
in the world we live in today.

00:00:57.170 --> 00:01:00.040
So, I have no interest, Kiara,
(crowd applauds)

00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:02.620
to get your mom and dad mad at me,

00:01:02.620 --> 00:01:04.860
but, I would tell you,
(crowd laughs)

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:07.490
that here would be my four year strategy.

00:01:07.490 --> 00:01:10.070
I would go to university, especially--

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:11.551
Is she going here in Canada?

00:01:11.551 --> 00:01:13.340
- [Richard] She's talking about NYU.

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:14.800
She's talking about San Fran'.

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:16.010
- Is she collecting debt,

00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:17.150
or are you guys paying for it?

00:01:17.150 --> 00:01:19.560
- [Richard] I think she's
just enamored by big brands.

00:01:19.560 --> 00:01:21.100
