00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:21.933
- [Richard] Yeah, well we're--

00:01:21.933 --> 00:01:22.766
yeah. We're paying for it.

00:01:22.766 --> 00:01:24.062
- So she's not collecting debt?

00:01:24.062 --> 00:01:25.340
- [Richard] No. Well yeah--

00:01:25.340 --> 00:01:26.760
I apologize. We're paying for it, and yes,

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:28.280
she's gonna have to
collect debt along the way.

00:01:28.280 --> 00:01:29.113
- All right, Kiara.

00:01:29.113 --> 00:01:30.730
You're gonna have to
have a weird conversation

00:01:30.730 --> 00:01:32.078
with your mom and dad.

00:01:32.078 --> 00:01:33.460
(crowd laughs)

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:35.150
Because the first thing
I'm passionate about,

00:01:35.150 --> 00:01:36.960
is for you to not have any debt.

00:01:36.960 --> 00:01:39.570
Because if you're gonna go to a business,

00:01:39.570 --> 00:01:42.180
