bankruptcy to get out of,

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:51.934
that's called extortion
fucked-up, fucking crazy-ass shit.

00:01:51.934 --> 00:01:54.684
(crowd applauds)

00:01:57.100 --> 00:01:58.190
But...

00:01:58.190 --> 00:01:59.470
but, Kiara,

00:01:59.470 --> 00:02:01.280
if that number's not that high,

00:02:01.280 --> 00:02:02.550
and you can get some other things,

00:02:02.550 --> 00:02:04.870
that drives down that cost.

00:02:04.870 --> 00:02:06.570
The second move would be,

00:02:06.570 --> 00:02:10.160
to take your last four
year vacation of your life.

00:02:10.160 --> 00:02:11.817
Hookup a whole bunch

00:02:11.817 --> 00:02:13.390
- [Crowd] Oh!
(crowd laughs)

00:02:13.390 --> 00:02:14.450
- Or! Or not a--

00:02:14.450 --> 00:02:16.970
You know, depending on
your own radar, Kiara.

00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:18.170
That might be one dude, seven.

00:02:18.170 --> 00:02:19.820
That's on you; don't let them judge.

00:02:19.820 --> 00:02:21.280
- [Richard] She's a nice,
good Christian girl now

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:23.000
- I'm sure she is.
(Richard laughs)

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:25.440
(crowd laughs)

00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:30.440
And if you want to learn about
marketing and communications,

00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:33.060
Spend a lot of time online,

00:02:33.060 --> 00:02:37.190
